    },
    {
      "id": "r025",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1248,
      "src": "━━ 1 · FLUENCIA EN EL ÁREA BRUTA (Ec. D2-1, phi = 0.90) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r026",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1296,
      "src": "El estado dúctil: área BRUTA y el phi generoso — en tracción casi nunca gobierna"
    },
    {
      "id": "r027",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1344,
      "src": "Rd_flu := 0.90*F_y*A_g = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_flu",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1392,
      "src": "Rd_flu >= P_u ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r028",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1456,
      "src": "━━ 2 · ROTURA POR RETRASO DE CORTANTE (Ec. D2-2 / D3-1 · Caso 5, phi = 0.75) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r029",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1504,
      "src": "La ranura corta las dos paredes por donde pasa la plancha: se descuentan dos franjas t·w_r (B4.3)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r030",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1552,
      "src": "A_n := A_g - 2*t_d*w_r = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r031",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1600,
      "src": "Caso 5 de la Tabla D3.1 (360-22): x̄ es el centroide de media sección, ESPESOR INCLUIDO"
    },
    {
      "id": "r032",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1648,
      "src": "(en 360-16 esta configuración era el Caso 6 y su x̄ ignoraba el espesor)"
    },
    {
      "id": "r033",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1696,
      "src": "b := B/2 = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r034",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1744,
      "src": "num_x := 2*b^2 + t_d*H - 2*t_d^2 = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r035",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1792,
      "src": "den_x := 2*H + 4*b - 4*t_d = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r036",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1840,
      "src": "x_bar := b - num_x/den_x = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r037",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1888,
      "src": "U_5 := 1 - x_bar/l_w ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r038",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1936,
      "src": "A_e := A_n*U_5 = cm^2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r039",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1984,
      "src": "Rd_ro := 0.75*F_u*A_e = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_ro",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2032,
      "src": "Rd_ro >= P_u ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r040",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2080,
      "src": "GOBIERNA: paga dos peajes (área menor y phi 0.75) que pesan más que el mayor F_u"
    },
    {
      "id": "r041",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2144,
      "src": "━━ 3 · SOLDADURA — la longitud que fija todo (Ec. J2-4, phi = 0.75) ━━"
    },
    {
      "id": "r042",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2192,
      "src": "Cordón longitudinal (theta = 0): garganta efectiva 0.707·w por el corte del metal de aporte"
    },
    {
      "id": "r043",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2240,
      "src": "Rn_cm := 0.75*0.6*F_EXX*(0.707*w_s) = kgf/cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "r044",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2288,
      "src": "l_min := P_u/(4*Rn_cm) = cm"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_lmin",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2336,
      "src": "l_w >= l_min ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r045",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2384,
      "src": "Se adopta l_w = 15 cm > mínimo: el retraso de cortante del §2 PREMIA la conexión larga"
    },
    {
      "id": "r046",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2432,
      "src": "Rd_sol := 4*Rn_cm*l_w = tonf"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_sol",
      "kind": "math",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2480,
      "src": "Rd_sol >= P_u ="
    },
    {
      "id": "r047",
      "kind": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2528,
      "src": "La palanca en acción (tabla de la nota del post): con l = 20 cm suben U y la rotura"
